# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Deploy and manage [Odoo](https://www.odoo.com/), a comprehensive open-source enterprise resource planning (ERP) solution within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem. Odoo provides a fully integrated suite of business applications including CRM, sales, inventory, accounting, HR, marketing, and website tools."
