# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers automatically generating and updating role-local `javascript.js`, `javascript.js.j2`, and equivalent injected browser entry files. Use this page for implementation scope, DOM strategy, and live review. For injector wiring, activation, and repository-wide behavior rules, see [Contributing `javascript.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/javascript.js.md)."
