msgid "What does separate them is the role's own account of what it deploys: the upstream homepage and the image it pulls. ``Mastodon`` sits inside ``joinmastodon.org``; ``Cleanup Disc Space`` sits inside nothing. Every word of the title must appear, not the title as one string, because a product spells its parts in either order: ``Claude Code`` lives at ``code.claude.com``."
