# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS (Your Own URL Shortener) is an open‑source URL shortening solution that enables you to create, track, and manage short links with ease. This deployment leverages Docker to provide a secure and easily scalable environment, ensuring that your YOURLS instance is configured for optimal performance and reliability."
msgstr "ΣΑΣ (Ο δικός σας συντομευτής URL) είναι μια λύση συντόμευσης URL ανοιχτού κώδικα που σας επιτρέπει να δημιουργήσετε, να παρακολουθείτε και να διαχειριστείτε τις μικρές συνδέσεις με ευκολία. Αυτή η ανάπτυξη μόχλευση Docker να παρέχει ένα ασφαλές και εύκολα κλιμακούμενο περιβάλλον, εξασφαλίζοντας ότι σας YOURLS το παράδειγμα έχει ρυθμιστεί για τη βέλτιστη απόδοση και αξιοπιστία."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "Το διοικητικό συμβούλιο κόβεται από την outh2-επικεφαλής ταυτότητας περίπου από το ``shunt_is_valid_user`` dropιάβαση ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona παραμένει ζωντανή και ασκεί τη γέφυρα τέλος."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "Το διοικητικό συμβούλιο κόβεται από την outh2-επικεφαλής ταυτότητας περίπου από το `shunt_is_valid_user` dropιάβαση [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), η οποία τιμά την επικεφαλίδα μόνο στην πύλη διαδρομή admin και μόνο για τα μέλη της YOURLS ομάδα διαχείρισης. Η ίδια η πύλη παραδέχεται μόνο τον ίδιο όμιλο RBAC ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), έτσι `biber` απορρίπτεται πριν YOURLS αποδίδει οτιδήποτε: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) δηλώνει `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, και η άρνηση υποστηρίζεται ρητά από `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`- Το `administrator` persona παραμένει ζωντανή και ασκεί τη γέφυρα τέλος."

