# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[AGENTS.md](../../../../../AGENTS.md) forbids `for` / `while` / `until` loops in Bash invocations, and `Bash(for *)` / `Bash(while *)` / `Bash(until *)` are in `deny` to enforce the rule. Every task has a flat-form equivalent: a single `grep` with multiple file arguments, `xargs`, a recursive glob, or a dedicated tool."
