msgstr "``roles/<app>/meta/server.yml`` δηλώνει ``status_codes`` Κλειδωμένο όπως ``domains.canonical``; Είναι η μοναδική πηγή αλήθειας για κάθε επαγγελματία."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``roles/<application_id>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`` Follow `Contributing ``playwright.env.j2`` <../../docs/agents/files/role/playwright.env.j2.md>`__ and `Contributing ``playwright.spec.js`` <../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md>`__ while creating them."
msgstr "``roles/<application_id>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`` Συνέχεια `Contributing ``playwright.env.j2`` <../../docs/agents/files/role/playwright.env.j2.md>`__ και `Contributing ``playwright.spec.js`` <../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md>`__ ενώ τα δημιουργείς."

